1
00:00:09,840 --> 00:00:16,320
Interrogator: Kellar, J. Sergeant First Class,
serial number 7178412.

2
00:00:18,020 --> 00:00:22,980
Interrogator: Iran, Guatemala, Colombia, Croatia.
Very impressive.

3
00:00:23,720 --> 00:00:26,100
Sgt. Kellar: I know what you're trying to do, sir.
It ain't going to work.

4
00:00:26,220 --> 00:00:29,340
Interrogator: No, Sergeant Kellar. You don't know
what I'm trying to do.

5
00:00:29,780 --> 00:00:31,380
Interrogator: I'm here to clean up this mess.

6
00:00:33,980 --> 00:00:35,380
Interrogator: If you cooperate.

7
00:00:35,380 --> 00:00:36,300
Interrogator: If...

8
00:00:42,090 --> 00:00:43,690
Interrogator: I walk out that door,

9
00:00:44,450 --> 00:00:46,630
Interrogator: everything you did will be declassified.

10
00:00:46,790 --> 00:00:47,650
Interrogator: You will be convicted.

11
00:00:48,030 --> 00:00:48,730
Interrogator: You will be discharged.

12
00:00:49,170 --> 00:00:51,910
Interrogator: You will spend the rest of your life in prison.

13
00:00:54,510 --> 00:00:55,130
Interrogator: Very well, Sergeant.

14
00:00:55,750 --> 00:00:56,550
Interrogator: Have it your way.

15
00:01:03,430 --> 00:01:05,000
Sgt. Kellar: Wait.

16
00:01:05,290 --> 00:01:06,370
Sgt. Kellar: What do you want me to do?

17
00:01:15,860 --> 00:01:18,460
Interrogator: Tell me everything you know about Seventh Wave.

18
00:01:20,840 --> 00:01:22,800
Sgt. Kellar: Weapons dealers, heavy hitters,

19
00:01:22,800 --> 00:01:25,420
Sgt. Kellar: dealing mostly in high-spec former
Eastern Bloc hardware.

20
00:01:26,300 --> 00:01:27,940
Sgt. Kellar: Clients began to include terrorist cells.

21
00:01:28,840 --> 00:01:32,780
Sgt. Kellar: Seventh Wave was escalated to priority status
after they took out nine agency spooks.

22
00:01:33,920 --> 00:01:34,920
Sgt. Kellar: Coordinated executions.

23
00:01:40,080 --> 00:01:41,300
Sgt. Kellar: Division wanted Seventh Wave taken out

24
00:01:41,360 --> 00:01:42,760
Sgt. Kellar: with extreme prejudice.

25
00:01:44,240 --> 00:01:45,800
Sgt. Kellar: Intel zeroed in on three possible targets.

26
00:01:47,060 --> 00:01:50,260
Sgt. Kellar: Valencio was the boss; Ruben and Yev Dejanka
were the muscle.

27
00:01:51,360 --> 00:01:54,160
Sgt. Kellar: Three teams were tasked with overwatch
until it was time to take them out.

28
00:01:55,340 --> 00:01:56,080
Sgt. Kellar: I had one of those teams.

29
00:01:57,160 --> 00:02:00,100
Sgt. Kellar: Intel suspected the Brits, Chinese and Israelis
had teams in the area.

30
00:02:01,340 --> 00:02:02,280
Sgt. Kellar: Everyone was after these guys.

31
00:02:02,980 --> 00:02:04,520
Interrogator: Who was the fourth man?

32
00:02:06,380 --> 00:02:07,380
Sgt. Kellar: Gun-for-hire.

33
00:02:07,560 --> 00:02:08,920
Sgt. Kellar: Didn't think much of him at the time.

34
00:02:10,320 --> 00:02:11,400
Interrogator: What went wrong?

35
00:02:17,740 --> 00:02:18,900
Sgt. Kellar: We got made.
